---
<Studio title="Careers at Synchro Social | Remote jobs" description="Remote jobs in social media, editing, design and operations at Synchro Social, a Miami social media agency with a team across the US and LATAM." page="careers">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <h1>Do the best work of your career, from anywhere.</h1>
    <div class="hb"><p class="lede">We're a social media agency based in Miami, with video editors, social media managers and designers across the US and LATAM.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="#roles">Open roles</a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap stats" aria-label="About us">
    <div><b>2022</b><span>in business since</span></div>
    <div><b>1.2B</b><span>views generated for our clients</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap sec">
    <h2 class="sh">Who we look for</h2>
    <div class="cc">
      <div><h3>You live in AI tools</h3><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="b me">Write 5 hooks for this script</div><div class="b">1. Nobody tells doctors this about Instagram…</div></div><p>Claude every day, ChatGPT too.</p></div>
      <div><h3>You build relationships</h3><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sl"><span class="av">C</span><div><b>Client<small>10:42</small></b><div>Loved this week's plan, thank you!</div><span class="rx">+2 replies</span></div></div></div><p>You listen and you follow up.</p></div>
      <div><h3>You are proactive</h3><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="nt"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg></span><div><b>Caption typo fixed</b><small>Friday's reel. Nobody asked.</small></div><em>now</em></div></div><p>You fix it before anyone asks.</p></div>
      <div><h3>You care about the details</h3><div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="reel"><div class="fr"><span>Stop doing this</span><i></i></div><div class="mark"><b>0:03</b>The hook lands before they scroll.</div></div></div><p>The hook, the pacing, the last frame.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="band"><div class="wrap sec">
    <h2 class="sh">How we work</h2>
    <div class="bl">{how.map(([t, p]) => <div class={wd[t] ? "w" : "t"}><h3>{t}</h3>{wd[t] && <div class="wdg" aria-hidden="true" set:html={wd[t]} />}<p>{p}</p></div>)}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="wrap sec" id="roles">
    <h2 class="sh">Open roles</h2>
    <div class="roles"><div class="role"><h3>No open roles right now, but we always want to meet great people</h3><p>We are not hiring for a specific seat today. Send your portfolio and a few lines about the best work you have made. We read everything, and we post every new role on LinkedIn first.</p><a class="go link" id="copymail" href="mailto:hello@synchrosocial.com?subject=Talent%20pool">Email us your portfolio</a><span class="copied" id="copied" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span> <a class="go link" href={LINKEDIN} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on LinkedIn</a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="band" id="reviews"><div class="wrap sec end">
    <h2>Hear it from the team</h2>
    <p><b>4.2 out of 5 on Glassdoor</b> from 7 reviews, and 85% would recommend us to a friend.</p>
    <div class="cta"><a class="btn ghost" href={GLASSDOOR_EN} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the reviews</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="wrap sec split">
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">{faqs.map(([q, a]) => <details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div>
  </section>
</Studio>
<script is:inline>(function(){var a=document.getElementById('copymail'),m=document.getElementById('copied'),t;if(!a)return;a.addEventListener('click',function(e){var addr='hello@synchrosocial.com';function done(ok){m.textContent=ok?'Copied '+addr+'. Paste it into your email.':'Email us at '+addr;m.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(t);t=setTimeout(function(){m.classList.remove('show')},4500)}
if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){e.preventDefault();navigator.clipboard.writeText(addr).then(function(){done(true)},function(){window.location.href=a.href;done(false)})}else{try{var i=document.createElement('textarea');i.value=addr;i.style.position='fixed';i.style.opacity='0';document.body.appendChild(i);i.select();var ok=document.execCommand('copy');document.body.removeChild(i);if(ok){e.preventDefault();done(true)}}catch(x){}}})})();</script>
<style is:global>
.copied{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--p-ink);font-weight:600}.copied.show{display:block;animation:cpd .3s ease}@keyframes cpd{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px)}}
.bl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--s5) var(--s6);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:var(--s4)}@media (min-width:821px){.bl{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 var(--s5)}.bl>.w{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 3;display:grid;grid-template-rows:subgrid}.bl>.t{grid-column:span 3;margin-top:var(--s5)}}
.wdg{margin:var(--s3) 0}.wd{background:var(--bg);border-radius:28px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:end;aspect-ratio:16/10;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #0000000d,0 14px 34px -14px #2b1a4a33;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.wd b{font:800 34px/1 var(--disp);letter-spacing:-.03em}.wd small{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;margin-top:4px}.wd svg{position:absolute;right:20px;top:20px;width:42%}.usd span{position:absolute;right:18px;top:6px;font:800 120px/1 var(--disp);color:#9fe870;-webkit-text-stroke:0}.usd{background:#163300!important;color:#9fe870}.usd small{color:#9fe870cc}.geo svg{width:78%;right:14px;top:18px}
.bl h3{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px}.bl p{color:var(--mute);max-width:46ch}
@media (max-width:820px){.bl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--s4)}}
</style>
